surrendered. Sad day. In the battle at my hacienda, my compadre had all been killed by Captain McCain

00:57:47.520 --> 00:57:55.870
and his men. My courier and I were the only ones left. We went upstairs with the captain. I thought

00:57:55.870 --> 00:57:58.230
to talk terms of the peace.

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:32.180
From this time on, I intend to do something with my life.

00:58:32.770 --> 00:58:34.980
Oh? In what way?

00:58:37.080 --> 00:58:37.780
I'm not yet sure.

00:58:39.080 --> 00:58:43.930
That I shall renounce the life I have led, try to make amends.

00:58:47.260 --> 00:58:48.820
Please, Captain, you're not going to live that long.

00:58:53.560 --> 00:58:55.160
I don't understand. The war has ended.

00:59:00.190 --> 00:59:07.390
branded as a traitor. By whom? By the United States government. That's impossible. I'm a Mexican

00:59:07.390 --> 00:59:12.940
soldier. I fully realize that. She declared this Hacienda and all your land grant as neutral

00:59:12.940 --> 00:59:19.820
territory. You were given military sanctuary as though you were an American citizen. What did

00:59:19.820 --> 00:59:26.680
you do? Fortified this place. Set yourself up as a guerrilla chief. Raided our supply lines and

00:59:26.680 --> 00:59:29.800
engaged in espionage. After your troops invaded my land.

00:59:30.480 --> 00:59:33.620
You violated the agreement with your country. I did these things rightfully as a soldier.

00:59:36.230 --> 00:59:37.810
It doesn't do any good to plead your case to me.

00:59:38.440 --> 00:59:40.160
I'm just a man who's going to take you back to be shot.

00:59:46.260 --> 00:59:47.740
Unless, of course, you want to make a deal.

00:59:49.220 --> 00:59:49.680
Who's that?

00:59:54.120 --> 00:59:56.280
Swap the Sebastian land grant for your life.

01:00:02.880 --> 01:00:04.860
All you've got to do is sign the deed and we'll turn you loose.

01:00:04.980 --> 01:00:05.780
You can go anyplace you want.

01:00:06.160 --> 01:00:06.760
Right, Pardee?

01:00:07.370 --> 01:00:08.130
That's right, Captain.

01:00:18.720 --> 01:00:19.500
Legas to the chest.

01:00:20.240 --> 01:00:20.860
See you, Capitano.

01:00:25.440 --> 01:00:25.780
Yes, sir.

01:00:33.930 --> 01:00:37.790
Johnson, Poyle, the captain wants to see him.

01:00:54.420 --> 01:00:56.200
Handsome box, that's the family crest.

01:00:57.130 --> 01:00:59.960
Yes, bastion.

01:01:00.030 --> 01:01:02.540
He came from Granada, in the time of Cortes.

01:01:04.580 --> 01:01:07.580
This encomienda, this land grant, of which we speak,

01:01:09.480 --> 01:01:11.680
granted to my family by Philip, King of Spain.

01:01:16.100 --> 01:01:16.880
What's this all about?

01:01:17.760 --> 01:01:18.500
You're gonna get rich.

01:01:19.060 --> 01:01:20.420
What does it amount to, a couple of hundred acres?

01:01:21.370 --> 01:01:21.910
A couple of hundred.

01:01:24.200 --> 01:01:26.920
This says west from the Pecos to the Rio Grande,

01:01:28.780 --> 01:01:29.980
north from Chihuahua...

01:01:32.880 --> 01:01:34.300
Nobody owns that much land.

01:01:36.030 --> 01:01:38.330
This document's official. It's recorded here.

01:01:38.900 --> 01:01:40.940
And you'll sign it over to us if we let you go loose?

01:01:41.460 --> 01:01:42.400
That is what we discussed.

01:01:43.180 --> 01:01:45.660
What if he has brothers or relatives? Somebody to challenge it.

01:01:46.210 --> 01:01:47.670
I am the last of my family.

01:01:49.110 --> 01:01:50.710
Captain, you're under orders to take this man back.

01:01:51.790 --> 01:01:53.230
So? We report him killed in action.

01:01:54.220 --> 01:01:57.320
It won't work. It will if everybody keeps his mouth shut.

01:01:58.080 --> 01:01:59.960
Captain, you're using Uncle Sam's uniform to ext...

01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:03.350
We volunteered for the duration of conflict. Our duty is done.

01:02:04.770 --> 01:02:07.420
Senor, predate that back to last year.

01:02:08.370 --> 01:02:12.390
Just in case anybody inquires as to when and under what circumstances we acquired it.

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:15.630
Of course, Captain. What is your full name?

01:02:16.320 --> 01:02:17.400
Angus Clyde McCain.

01:02:19.000 --> 01:02:21.630
Captain, this is collaboration with the enemy. We're not discharged yet.

01:02:22.530 --> 01:02:24.290
God, all you've got to do is witness this signature.

01:02:25.720 --> 01:02:27.360
I'm sorry, sir. I'm under military orders.

01:02:28.530 --> 01:02:29.890
Lieutenant Johnson, this is a good soldier.

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:31.560
who's going to be shot if we take him back.

01:02:32.770 --> 01:02:33.890
We're going to let him live.

01:02:35.750 --> 01:02:41.120
You either sign this deed or be listed as one of our casualties.

01:03:02.300 --> 01:03:02.620
Marty.

01:03:30.350 --> 01:03:33.610
You and your man can shed those uniforms and pack whatever equipment you need.

01:03:43.880 --> 01:03:49.190
Some of the people who live on this land have served my family for many years.

01:03:50.540 --> 01:03:52.580
I've given them the small farms which they worked.

01:03:53.560 --> 01:03:54.700
They will be permitted to remain.

01:03:55.820 --> 01:03:56.780
They'll be treated fairly.

01:03:57.770 --> 01:03:59.330
Gracias. I'm sure they will.

01:04:00.760 --> 01:04:01.440
What are you heading for?

01:04:03.060 --> 01:04:03.440
Yes, Harvey.

01:04:05.690 --> 01:04:07.070
So many forgotten places.

01:04:11.000 --> 01:04:11.400
Seniors?

01:04:12.660 --> 01:04:13.760
Thank you for another life.

01:04:14.620 --> 01:04:14.820
Adios.

01:04:28.090 --> 01:04:28.610
Hermanos!

01:04:35.240 --> 01:04:35.500
R.D.

01:04:37.100 --> 01:04:37.300
Thank you.

01:04:40.140 --> 01:04:41.440
head of the post, and, uh...

01:04:42.920 --> 01:04:44.180
Send us a burial detail.

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:00.460
or dead.

01:06:01.620 --> 01:06:03.440
It was God's will to keep me alive.

01:06:07.730 --> 01:06:08.190
Thank you.

01:06:09.290 --> 01:06:09.850
Thank you.

01:06:10.810 --> 01:06:12.810
Father, are you telling this court?

01:06:13.340 --> 01:06:17.860
That the defendant McCain forced you to trade your life for your land?

01:06:19.960 --> 01:06:20.760
We made a bargain.

01:06:22.810 --> 01:06:24.110
And I thought he meant to keep it.

01:06:24.890 --> 01:06:27.750
In your opinion, was this transfer of land legal?

01:06:28.540 --> 01:06:29.060
The transfer?

01:06:30.660 --> 01:06:31.880
The transfer was legal.

01:06:34.280 --> 01:06:34.780
Thank you.

01:06:36.520 --> 01:06:36.780
other.

01:06:37.100 --> 01:06:38.320
The fact that you're alive.

01:06:38.760 --> 01:06:42.940
There's prima facie evidence that the defendant McCain altered military records.

01:06:43.400 --> 01:06:45.060
We're here to question my ownership of land.

01:06:45.670 --> 01:06:47.030
not my military background.

01:06:47.560 --> 01:06:49.000
They're tied together in this case.

01:06:49.580 --> 01:06:51.040
Were you a captain in the Mexican army?

01:06:51.500 --> 01:06:52.020
I was.

01:06:52.520 --> 01:06:54.160
Were you a captain in the U.S. Cavalry?

01:06:54.380 --> 01:06:54.840
That's right.

01:06:55.530 --> 01:06:56.090
The fifth.

01:06:57.030 --> 01:06:58.710
There's no further need to question any witnesses.

01:06:59.460 --> 01:06:59.980
A matter of...

01:07:00.000 --> 01:07:01.100
The jurisdiction is involved.

01:07:01.590 --> 01:07:02.430
Jury is dismissed.

01:07:03.960 --> 01:07:05.600
I'm not standing trial without a jury.

01:07:06.040 --> 01:07:07.260
You're not dismissed, McCain.

01:07:08.090 --> 01:07:08.470
Sit down.

01:07:33.810 --> 01:07:54.890
...of this country clearly states that no United States soldier can bargain with the enemy in wartime.

01:07:55.700 --> 01:07:59.970
Therefore, the defendant, Angus McCain, never legally acquired title...

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:01.300
of the Sebastian Land Grant.

01:08:02.010 --> 01:08:04.510
It is still in the possession of the good father, Sebastian.

01:08:05.140 --> 01:08:06.340
And he can do with it as he wishes.

01:08:11.060 --> 01:08:11.640
Angus McCain.

01:08:12.060 --> 01:08:15.240
I hereby remand you to the custody of the United States, Marshal.

01:08:15.990 --> 01:08:18.490
for a transfer to Fort Leavenworth, Kansas.

01:08:18.900 --> 01:08:21.940
where you will stand trial under military court-martial

01:08:21.940 --> 01:08:25.640
on charges of collaboration with the enemy and high treason.

01:08:26.650 --> 01:08:29.110
So found this day in court and recorded.

01:08:31.080 --> 01:08:31.780
Thank you very much.

01:10:07.100 --> 01:10:12.980
I guess you can't herd cattle the way you do people.

01:10:17.880 --> 01:10:19.620
You lose more hearts that way.

01:10:30.240 --> 01:10:31.460
McCain's dead. Let's get out of here.

01:11:00.120 --> 01:11:01.480
Killed by his own stampede.

01:11:04.440 --> 01:11:05.780
Well, I guess it settles its claim.

01:11:09.080 --> 01:11:11.120
I'm happy you have your land back again, father.

01:11:12.410 --> 01:11:13.150
No, my child.

01:11:13.820 --> 01:11:15.520
The land belongs to the people who live on it.

01:11:16.980 --> 01:11:17.760
And with your help,

01:11:18.360 --> 01:11:19.500
and we won't make it legal.
